  "description": "World-renowned actress Son Yu-Ri has it all: beauty, talent, and now even unimaginable wealth upon her marriage to IT magnate, Dave Cheon. But the happiest day of Yu-Ri’s life soon becomes the worst when her husband suddenly goes missing after the first night of their honeymoon. With them having been the only two on their yacht in the middle of the vast sea, Yu-Ri is immediately suspected of murdering Dave. Just when the entire world seems to be against her, Yu-Ri is reunited with Lee Do-Jun, a lawyer and old acquaintance. Despite their complicated history and disadvantage in the case, Do-Jun is determined to prove Yu-Ri’s innocence by uncovering the truth behind this impossible mystery…\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
